=== [1/5] Gurobi-free structural tests (shared machinery, hetero fixtures) ===
level-chunk boundary tests (ascending half of the recursion)
  [1] ChunkScale coarsen/refine round-trip, payload conserved, budget is a ratio OK
  [2] GCD rule: rail AG=8, hetero AG=2 (cells are 4/4/6), hetero A2A=8, coprime/empty -> 1 OK
  [3] rescale_to_chunk: epoch 0.02 -> 0.16 (x8), per-epoch link capacity invariant at 1 chunk, demand -> 1/pair OK
  [4] g == 1 is an exact no-op (topology, demand, scale all unchanged) OK
  [5] every level-boundary scale round-trips through JSON exactly OK
level-chunk tests OK
  [1] identity_sets counts == coarsify_demand (AllGather + AllToAll) OK
  [2] Host B forced-relay oracle (3 coalesced egress relays, native exempt; self_distribution disjoint from staging) OK
  [3] symmetric case: zero egress relay OK
  [4] AllToAll single-GPU ingress target OK
  [1a] Host-B _to_jobs: 3 hard relays (redundant self-twins deduped) + 9 soft OK
  [1b] isolated fan-out -> binomial tree (7 edges, depth 3, precedence) OK
  [2a] ring recovery: 7 rounds, each a distance-(r+1) permutation OK
  [2b] relay priority: far-distance hard job pulled to round 0 OK
  [2c] fractional 0.5+0.5 packs into one round, ports safe OK
  [2d] tree fan-out respects precedence, 3 rounds (log2 depth) OK
  [3] schedule_cell Host-B combined: B gaps [0], 12 B-flows / 12 A-flows / 20 C-flows, relays land + fan-out delivered, ports & deadlines OK
intra-solve step-1/2/3 tests OK
send-pacing gate derivation tests
  [OK] concern1a: multi-peer, same epoch, not serialized
  [OK] concern1b: multipath channels, same epoch, not serialized
  [OK] contiguous chain: gate on the send that frees the link
  [OK] concern2: multi-epoch send does not serialize a later one
  [OK] gap: pin to the latest finishing predecessor
  [OK] cross-gpu: independent uplinks, no edges
  [OK] multi-uplink: different first switch, independent, no edges
  [OK] same uplink, different downstream path, still chains
pacing gate tests OK
